- people uses events (+lines, duties reads for person duties, money reads for interestsOf/given-received) -> people after duties & money.
- duties pay-occurrence needs money facts -> money before duties. Money restriction check (flow vs prohibition) -> home in calculations compare (labelled computed fact) or duties occurrence evidence; NOT in money (avoid money->duties). money uses: entities, events, lines, standards, progressions (junction checks), civil-time, calc-grammar. Not people, not duties.
